# The root of the UPM package is the repository root, so the .NET side must be kept out of the
# published artifacts: otherwise Unity would compile the .cs files under Core/ and Generator/ as
# well, duplicating the types already shipped in the Plugins DLL (CS0433), and the Generator would
# fail to compile because Microsoft.CodeAnalysis is not referenced.
# The published package only keeps the dll/xml/pdb files under Unity/Plugins (including the two
# Roslyn components: the generator and the analyzer).
*Project*~/

Core/
Generator/
Directory.Build.props

.github/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.editorconfig
.DotSettings
*.sln
